# MIDI CC in, channel 1: the knobs (CC_MAP in ui.c), 0..127 over each one's range, 64 a centred knob's 0
wait 300
# CC 20: the chord's level (P_CHORD, 0..100)
midi B0 14 00
wait 20
expect par0 0
expect dirty 1
expect bigring 1
midi B0 14 7F
wait 20
expect par0 100
midi B0 14 40
wait 20
expect par0 50
# CC 1, the mod wheel: the DJ filter, -50 Shut .. +50 Open, Off at 64
midi B0 01 00
wait 20
expect filter -50
midi B0 01 7F
wait 20
expect filter 50
midi B0 01 40
wait 20
expect filter 0
# CC 71: the chord's Resonance (P_CRES, -50..50)
midi B0 47 00
wait 20
expect par38 -50
midi B0 47 40
wait 20
expect par38 0
# CC 94: the echo's time, a switch (P_ETIME, 0..5)
midi B0 5E 7F
wait 20
expect par9 5
midi B0 5E 00
wait 20
expect par9 0
# another channel, and a CC not in the map: nothing
midi B1 14 7F
wait 20
expect par0 50
midi B0 0A 7F
wait 20
expect par0 50
wait 300
shot cc.png
